    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yotam was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yotam abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew damwalah aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yerusha was hudeaba Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin doobiiwnata aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji ng'asheega sean ghayi sin ghwaan was Usiya nea gida masina ea beata jeeda gheeda sibata NG'UTAMIIDA. Nea buuneeda ea gudu gwasina ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas gidaghuuta heetiyeada bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwadeas muuchi ghamarda Ofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas mujiinajeega aba ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Yuda, ea hilooga ea madalajeega aba dareabeeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gang'uchi sea sugoocheanda fuga Amoni ak ghwajoar. Ak fuga Amoni aba gweaydida ghoadaw niny dalaantaji bughala bea lapiya, ea gweeraji sagalamnyooji damanamughuush bea ngaano ea gweeraji sagalamnyooji damanamughuush bea nganooyda siguura shayiiri. Hean fuga Amoni ghoadayda giteena mooneedida gweaydeaba iyeenya ea samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyas uurda Yotam aba gideaba ghoadoabiiw naweadaanyi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadiyoojiga siipuut bea Yotam, ea ng'ucheadaanyi sean, ea naweadingaaschi, ng'ula sing'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Israeli ea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut damanda ambaliischeewa, ak goombaliischi gweanyeew damwan lah aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghameawda Yotam gidameawda ghweanigaaschi, ak geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi; ak goombaliischi orjeedaanyi siguura Ahasi aba hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
